      "role": "user",
      "content": "trolls?? lol anyway i hear you on the temp. we checked the thermometers and they seem steady at 200c, and the pressure is definitely high enough. its weird because the ink looks fine on the paper before we press it, but then once it's on the fabric it just looks like it's missing half the pigment. like parts of the design just vanish. is there any reason the ink would just not transfer properly even if the heat is right?",
      "source": "evaluator"
